# Claude Code — local-only LLM tooling. Project-level guidance lives in
# AGENTS.md (the tool-agnostic convention). Anything under .claude/ is
# either local config (settings.local.json) or ephemeral worktrees, and
# never belongs in the public repo.
/CLAUDE.md
/.claude/

*.mx
*.realm
*.realm.lock

# react-native-config — runtime env (OAuth client IDs etc). Per-developer
# / per-CI; never committed. The .env.example template DOES live in git
# as a self-documenting list of expected keys.
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local

# Local-only TS secrets module (relay API key etc). Per-developer / per-CI;
# never committed. The .example.ts template DOES live in git.
blue_modules/secrets.ts

# Reproducible-build outputs: `make repro-build` AAB + walletscrutiny verdict file
/out/
walletscrutiny/COMPARISON_RESULTS.yaml